40
00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:27.952
Malis goes snorkelling near Koh Rong. She sees a sea turtle swimming slowly. A big manta ray glides past. Colourful anemones wave in the water. A sea snail and a sea cucumber move on the sand. Barnacles live on the rocks. A crab shows its claw! Far away, she sees a shark fin. Swim back!

